<div class="cover">
  <div class="cover-label">Confidential Investment Analysis · May 2026</div>
  <h1>Should you buy land<br>in <em>Misiones</em>?</h1>
  <p style="font-size:15px; opacity:0.7; max-width:480px; margin-top:12px; font-weight:300;">A full financial, strategic, and personal analysis — cross-referencing current market data, the yerba mate crisis, your portfolio context, and your life plan.</p>
  <div class="cover-sub">Prepared for David · Wuppertal → Misiones scenario · $30,000–$50,000 budget · 25 ha target</div>
</div>
 
<div class="meta-strip">
  <div class="meta-item"><span>Budget</span>$30–50k USD</div>
  <div class="meta-item"><span>Target</span>25+ hectares</div>
